pan><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f76c99f69499336d\" href=\"?note=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 13"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"34"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"45"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述已核对；未独立完成全部基础事实或原书证明的形式验证"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq Q\">\\(T\\supseteq Q\\)</span> 为一致固定原始递归公理呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\nvdash\\alpha\">\\(T\\nvdash\\alpha\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\alpha=T\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}\">\\(T+\\alpha=T\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}\\)</span> 使用同一演算及自然证明编号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_T\">\\(\\ell_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"be38aee184dd1b06\" href=\"?note=be38aee184dd1b06\" title=\"67-df-proof-predicate\">67-df-proof-predicate</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"45046cfa53052599\" href=\"?note=45046cfa53052599\" title=\"67-df-proof-length\">67-df-proof-length</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 表示上述固定自然原始递归句法编号；句法对象与自然数编码、对象语言数词分别使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本原子固定的编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 与所引 Proof_T、Prf_T、Prov_T 采用的呈示编号相同；所有编码变换均在该固定编号下使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\quad\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ \\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nT\\vdash\\theta\\land\\mathrm{Proof}_{T+\\alpha}(q,g(\\theta))\\land\\ell_T(g(\\theta))&gt;f(q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\quad\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ \\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nT\\vdash\\theta\\land\\mathrm{Proof}_{T+\\alpha}(q,g(\\theta))\\land\\ell_T(g(\\theta))&gt;f(q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 2.13, p.34。固定点令 ψ 表示 α∨ψ 在增强理论中存在较短证明而 T 中没有相应有界证明，取 θ=α∨ψ。若 T 不证 θ，有限验证会使 T 证 ψ，矛盾；若 T 中有过短证明，会导出 T⊢α。严格不等号可对原书函数 f 使用 f+1 的变体。此条只保留书中陈述范围，未独立形式验证全部证明编码估计。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"be38aee184dd1b06","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-length","status":"resolved","id":"45046cfa53052599","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-proof-length]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f966a5415